{:fh/id  "FH-SUB-011"
 :fh/law "When an input a committed v/sub depends on changes value, a re-render recomputes it and the commit republishes the whole bundle atomically: the committed bundle is unchanged until the next commit, and the recommitted dependency then carries the NEW value against the SAME retained handle — the bundle flips as a unit, never a mix of one render's dependency and another's value."

 :query     [:sub/v]
 :db-before {:v 1}
 :db-after  {:v 2}

 :value-before 1
 :value-after  2

 :dependency-queries [[:sub/v]]}
